#: ../../kernel-dev/advanced.rst:672
msgid ""
"Conversely, if you are actively developing a kernel and are already "
"maintaining a Linux kernel Git repository of your own, you might find it "
"more convenient to work with kernel Metadata kept outside the recipe-"
"space. Working with Metadata in this area can make iterative development "
"of the Linux kernel more efficient outside of the BitBake environment."
