#: ../../kernel-dev/advanced.rst:682
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When stored in recipe-space, the kernel Metadata files reside in a "
"directory hierarchy below :term:`FILESEXTRAPATHS`. For a linux-yocto "
"recipe or for a Linux kernel recipe derived by copying :oe_git:`meta-"
"skeleton/recipes-kernel/linux/linux-yocto-custom.bb </openembedded-"
"core/tree/meta-skeleton/recipes-kernel/linux/linux-yocto-custom.bb>` into"
" your layer and modifying it, :term:`FILESEXTRAPATHS` is typically set to"
" ``${``\\ :term:`THISDIR`\\ ``}/${``\\ :term:`PN`\\ ``}``. See the \":ref"
":`kernel-dev/common:modifying an existing recipe`\" section for more "
"information."
