msgid "Machine Branches"
msgstr ""

#: ../../kernel-dev/advanced.rst:861
msgid ""
"When you have multiple machines and architectures to support, or you are "
"actively working on board support, it is more efficient to create "
"branches in the repository based on individual machines. Having machine "
"branches allows common source to remain in the development branch with "
"any features specific to a machine stored in the appropriate machine "
"branch. This organization method frees you from continually reintegrating"
" your patches into a feature."
