msgid ""
"If you had two kernel types, \"standard\" and \"small\" for instance, "
"three machines, and common as ``mydir``, the branches in your Git "
"repository might look like this::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../kernel-dev/advanced.rst:906
msgid ""
"This organization can help clarify the branch relationships. In this "
"case, ``mydir/standard/machine_a`` includes everything in ``mydir/base`` "
"and ``mydir/standard/base``. The \"standard\" and \"small\" branches add "
