#: ../../kernel-dev/advanced.rst:942
msgid "SCC Description File Reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../kernel-dev/advanced.rst:944
msgid ""
"This section provides a brief reference for the commands you can use "
"within an SCC description file (``.scc``):"
