"the :term:`SRC_URI`-specified configuration options to the kernel's "
"``meta`` branch. Not only is it easier for BSP developers not to have to "
"put those configurations in the branch, but having the maintainers do it "
"allows them to apply 'global' knowledge about the kinds of common "
"configuration options multiple BSPs in the tree are typically using. This"
" allows for promotion of common configurations into common features."
